      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NASANA NZ (4) has been excellent of late and she made it two in a row when successful at her latest appearance over 1740m at this track, getting home by 5.5 metres. Meeting a deeper field this time but she is good enough to play a major role. MIRADOR LASS (9) finished second two runs back and again performed impressively at the most recent appearance, making up plenty of ground in a long sustained run to grab third over 1720m at Young. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane. Needs to be at her best to beat this field but she is up to the challenge. SNIPERS FIRE (7) was responsible for a better effort last time out when third over 1740m at this track. Should run a big race. SECRETS KEPT (3) disappointed last time when sixth over 1740m at this track. Can do a lot better so worth considering.",
